e\, In progress\, or Blocked\, and record the evidence in the roadmap.\n\nDONE MEANS\nBack up\, deploy\, enable checkout\, migrate existing Beta accounts into the 30-day notice path\, smoke-test\, and keep rollback ready.\nCodex confirms the evidence was recorded and tells you to mark Done.\n\nHARD GATE\nYes
